"Outlines: ⟨a⟩GLIMS Glacier Database⟨b⟩ ({#}: Chinn, via the Randolph Glacier Inventory; {#}: Carrivick et al.). The areas are the ones stated with these outlines.": "Umrisse: ⟨a⟩GLIMS Glacier Database⟨b⟩ ({1}: Chinn, über das Randolph Glacier Inventory; {2}: Carrivick et al.). Die Flächen sind die zu diesen Umrissen angegebenen.",
