"({#}: Chinn, via the Randolph Glacier Inventory; {#}: Carrivick et al.). The areas are the ones stated with these outlines.": "({1}: Chinn, über das Randolph Glacier Inventory; {2}: Carrivick et al.). Die Flächen sind die zu diesen Umrissen angegebenen.",
"City outlines are the major urban areas of Stats NZ (Urban Rural Areas {#}, CC BY {#}), so they cover the built-up city and not the whole council district. A city you type comes from OpenStreetMap (administrative boundary, © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL, found with Nominatim).": "Die Stadtumrisse sind die «Major urban areas» von Stats NZ (Urban Rural Areas 2023, CC BY 4.0); sie umfassen die bebaute Stadt und nicht den ganzen Gemeindebezirk. Eine selbst eingegebene Stadt stammt aus OpenStreetMap (Verwaltungsgrenze, © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL, gefunden mit Nominatim).",
"Background: the Sentinel-{#} mosaic (cloudless {#} by EOX IT Services, CC BY-NC-SA {#}, contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data). OpenStreetMap background: © OpenStreetMap contributors. Place names: Labels © OpenStreetMap contributors, rendering EOX.": "Hintergrund: das Sentinel-{1}-Mosaik (wolkenfrei {2} von EOX IT Services, CC BY-NC-SA {3}, enthält modifizierte Copernicus-Sentinel-Daten). OpenStreetMap-Hintergrund: © OpenStreetMap contributors. Ortsnamen: Beschriftung © OpenStreetMap contributors, Darstellung EOX.",
"next to Wellington": "neben Wellington",
